      "author": "Yoshino2000",
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "进入指定网站或程序时发送自定义通知，支持多规则、启停和冷却时间",
        "en": "Custom notifications when entering a website or app, with multiple rules, pause switches and cooldowns"
      },
      "repo": "Yoshino2000/hindsight-reminder",
      "versions": [
        {
